            "text": "Clogged Sinuses? Plugged Nose? No More.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s147",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Imagine a key that unlocks clear breathi",
            "text": "Imagine a key that unlocks clear breathing. That's what Boom Boom Naturals Nasal Sticks do for the sinuses. First, Eucalyptus Oil in the stick breaks up any mucus. Then, Menthol reduces swelling in nasal passages, making more room for air. Finally, Peppermint Oil adds a fresh, cool sensation with each breath. All this happens in a quick whiff, instantly clearing sinuses. <br><br>No more blockage, no more struggle - just pure, crisp breaths every time.&nbsp;",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        ]
      }
